# This file keeps the empty oracle_wallet/ directory tracked in git.
#
# PUT YOUR ORACLE WALLET FILES HERE (on the Oracle Cloud Ubuntu VM only):
#   cwallet.sso  ewallet.pem  ewallet.p12  tnsnames.ora  sqlnet.ora
#   ojdbc.properties  keystore.jks  truststore.jks  README
#
# These come from the "DB Connection" -> "Download Wallet" (Instance Wallet)
# button in the Oracle Autonomous Database console. They contain PRIVATE KEYS
# and MUST NEVER be committed to git (see .gitignore — everything in this
# folder except this .gitkeep is ignored).
#
# docker-compose mounts this folder (or ORACLE_WALLET_HOST_DIR) read-only into
# every backend container at /oracle_wallet, which is what ORACLE_WALLET_DIR
# and TNS_ADMIN point to. On Neon/Render this folder stays empty and unused.
